  "goodToKnow": "Beliefern means to supply someone, with the customer as the direct object: Wir beliefern Restaurants mit frischem Gemüse. With liefern, the goods are the object: Wir liefern Gemüse an Restaurants. Die Belieferung is supply or delivery. Since 2022, the question of whether to beliefern Ukraine with weapons dominated German debates. Not separable: hat beliefert."
